<metadata><name>Snowlands 1106 Cabbage Patch to Poison Spring</name><desc>broken (legs do not join end to end). 5.4 miles one-way via road 5.6 miles one-way via woods and clearing. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/11/1106_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="38.412856" lon="-120.136319"><ele>2045.3</ele><name>1106-01 trailhead</name></wpt>
